<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech c.bank rev repo ave yield dips to 44.43 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech c.bank rev repo ave yield dips to 44.43 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield in a Czech central bank (CNB) one-week reverse repo tender draining liquidity from the market on Tuesday dipped to 44.43 percent, from 45 percent in its last one-week operation on Monday, the CNB said.</p>
</text>
